{"id":"5502","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5502_main_cirrus-uncinus-and-altocumulus-castellanus-and_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这幅天空景象令人印象深刻，暖锋前方的钩卷云正缓慢入侵天空。卷云显示出钩状云种的三个特征：白色；逗号状且在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">钩</span>的顶部终止；逗号状且在并非圆形凸起的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">簇</span>顶部终止。</p>\n<p>图底部有两个层积云种：<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">絮状</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">堡状</span>。有些堡状层积云垂直发展充分，可确定为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云性浓积云</span>。</p>\n<p>照片拍摄于高压区西南侧抵近的暖锋前方。钩卷云云量增加，但在2小时后便移出了该区域。在观测之时，钩卷云正在入侵天空，因此使用CH = 4。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰，埃斯波","latitude":"纬度: 60° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 25° 0' 0'' E","date":"06 June 2011 0543 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 4","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.3"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5502_syn_cirrus-uncinus-and-altocumulus-castellanus-and_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>照片拍摄于高压区西南侧抵近的暖锋前方。由于它受到该高压系统的影响，因而是一股弱锋。在地面难以确定锋的位置。850 hPa的相当位温表明该暖锋极为接近芬兰埃斯波，而厚度和平流图确定暖锋位于向南200-300公里。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© www.wetter3.de","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5502_upper_cirrus-uncinus-and-altocumulus-castellanus-and_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>探测地点是在向南80公里，时间为照片拍摄前4小时。在夜间，地表逆温加剧，其程度在芬兰大陆更强。探测显示出从地表逆温顶部（注意，芬兰大陆的逆温比爱沙尼亚塔林的逆温更强，即更暖）到2400米（760 hPa）之间的条件不稳定层，上方是更加稳定和干燥的中对流层。在探测时不可能爆发深对流。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4520_main_cirrus-fibratus-and-cirrus-uncinus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>一些近乎笔直的丝状卷云元素<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">在1</span> <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">和2处</span>出现。然而，大多数卷云细丝顶部带有小簇状结构(<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>)，因此属于钩卷云。前一日曾有冷锋过境；当日地面风力较弱。该区域位于西部600公里处的静止槽相关的弱西南急流之下，250百帕高度上西南风速达20米/秒。</p></div>","copyright":"© R.A. Keen","location":"Boulder, Colorado, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 40° 0' 54'' N","longitude":"经度: 105° 16' 14'' W","date":"11 July 1983 1000 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}